    title: "Coverage-gate adjudicability is a PRESENCE test: one catalogued primitive makes a whole module adjudicable, so a cosmetic module-string respell flips inconclusive to a false confirmed (measured, with controls)"  # 7808
    status: violated  # 7808
    priority: 1  # 7808
    parent:  # 7808
